What Was Built
CV Strength Analysis Engine (src/utils/cvAnalyzer.ts)
analyzeCvStrength(profile, bookmarkedJobs, fallbackJobs): Cross-references the candidate's CV profile against the specific requirements, job descriptions, and salary bands of all jobs they have bookmarked (or top matching jobs if none are bookmarked yet).
Four Core Evaluation Pillars:
Skills Coverage (40% weight): Detects overlapping competencies and identifies high-frequency skills that appear across bookmarked roles but are missing from the CV.
Experience & Seniority (25% weight): Compares the candidate’s total years of experience against seniority expectations across bookmarked positions.
Profile & File Completeness (20% weight): Verifies presence of an uploaded CV file (PDF/DOCX), contact info, key skills, and portfolio/GitHub links.
Salary Market Competitiveness (15% weight): Evaluates whether the candidate’s target VND salary is positioned comfortably within the compensation ranges offered by their bookmarked employers.
